しさが込み上げてきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「この次も受かりたい！」その気持ちのままshowroom審査までたどり着きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"showroom審査は本当に心臓が張り裂けるくらい緊張したのを今でも覚えています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何万人の人に見られている緊迫感と、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ている人が自分のことをどう思っているのかという不安感で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いままでの「受かりたい！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という気持ちよりも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「私、アイドルに向いてるのかな？本当にできるのかな？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というリアルに直面しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分自身すごく怖くなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"諦めそうにもなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「応援してるよ！」「7番ちゃんに会えるのを楽しみにしてるよ！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにも沢山の人に応援されたことは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生で初めてだったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの応援を無駄にはしたくない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまできたからには全力でやる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう決めて最終審査へと向かいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2017年8月13日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとオーディションに合格してアイドルになりました。そして2期生9人がはじめて集まりました。かけがえのない出会い。今までの人生が一変する大きな出来事です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから一年後の今日まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのことを経験させて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○Re:mindのオーディション"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○2期生の特設ページ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○欅って書けない？初登場。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○初めての雑誌の撮影・インタビュー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○2期生のみでヒット祈願ロケ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○ひらがな全国ツアー2017 FINAL!で初めてのライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○2期生曲「半分の記憶」"},{"type":"break"},{"